### A glance at a repository.

## The commands: what the palette and the command line call each, and what it does.

glance-repo-glance = Repositories at a glance
glance-repo-glance-description = For each folder given: the branch checked out, how far it is ahead and behind its upstream, and the uncommitted files by kind, or why it could not be looked at; params: paths (full paths, at most 64)

## Refusals.

# More folders were asked about than max.
glance-too-many = at most { $max } at a time
glance-not-a-full-path = each has to be the full path of a folder
